Production Music)

00:00:05.921 --> 00:00:07.490
- [Maya] My name is Maya Z.

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:09.997
The inventor of the selfie, perhaps.

00:00:09.997 --> 00:00:11.869
The perfectionist of the selfie,

00:00:12.728 --> 00:00:13.327
definitely.

00:00:13.327 --> 00:00:15.347
I'm the name behind many

00:00:15.347 --> 00:00:18.314
of the most selfies you've seen.

00:00:18.314 --> 00:00:21.653
The great Ellen photograph of the Oscars.

00:00:21.653 --> 00:00:23.162
Many of Kim Kardashian's.

00:00:23.162 --> 00:00:25.994
You would closely and you
can see me in the background

00:00:25.994 --> 00:00:27.917
directing it as if it were an orchestra.

00:00:27.917 --> 00:00:29.101
- That's why I'm here.

00:00:29.101 --> 00:00:30.053
'Cause she's the best.

00:00:30.053 --> 00:00:33.073
Yeah, I've always wanted to
be popular and I know that

00:00:33.073 --> 00:00:34.967
to be popular, it starts with Instagram.

00:00:34.967 --> 00:00:39.967
- I followed her work
with the iPhone 4, 4S.

00:00:40.078 --> 00:00:42.672
Oh, let's not forget about the 5 and 5S.

00:00:42.672 --> 00:00:44.084
- How does it smell in here?

00:00:46.354 --> 00:00:46.814
- Like

00:00:46.814 --> 00:00:48.184
art.
- A good selfie.

00:00:48.765 --> 00:00:52.869
My motto is know your selfie.

00:00:52.869 --> 00:00:54.866
What does the background, the lighting,

00:00:54.866 --> 00:00:57.095
the angle, what does it say about you?

00:00:57.095 --> 00:00:59.371
My friend, Joshua, took a picture

00:00:59.371 --> 00:01:02.529
with just a six pack and
he got like 500 likes

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:05.617
in 52 minutes, and he
changed his name to Viper.

00:01:05.617 --> 00:01:07.381
I just kinda wanted what Viper has.

00:01:07.381 --> 00:01:11.445
- My background is in
online dating selfies.

00:01:11.445 --> 00:01:15.044
You know, the lowest form of
selfie and I just asked myself

00:01:15.044 --> 00:01:16.451
what else is there?

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:17.463
- Can you please?

00:01:17.463 --> 00:01:18.113
- Beautiful.

00:01:18.113 --> 00:01:19.938
- Ah, thank you, but you're in it so.

00:01:20.217 --> 00:01:23.073
Say, you see a rabbit

00:01:23.073 --> 00:01:24.234
and you wanna catch that rabbit.

00:01:24.234 --> 00:01:26.695
You are the rabbit. You are the trap.

00:01:26.695 --> 00:01:28.297
You want to eat yourself for dinner.

00:01:28.297 --> 00:01:32.453
That, and if nothing else
is truly the definition of

00:01:32.453 --> 00:01:34.032
what it is to capture yourself.

00:01:34.032 --> 00:01:36.795
- I was a busboy at Joe's
Crab Shack for two years

00:01:36.795 --> 00:01:39.615
saving up so I could have
this experience with Maya Z.

00:01:39.615 --> 00:01:42.518
I am very intimidated to
be working with Maya today,

00:01:42.518 --> 00:01:43.771
but I'm also excited.

00:01:43.771 --> 00:01:46.483
- On a good day, we walk out of the studio

00:01:46.483 --> 00:01:49.710
with some amazing
selfies, and on a bad day,

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:54.647
I'll have to clean up a
lot of broken iPhone 6's.

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:57.627
- And no I will not
disclose which filters I may

00:01:57.627 --> 00:01:58.524
or may not use.

00:01:58.524 --> 00:01:59.694
I enjoy

00:02:02.085 --> 00:02:03.014
Siena.

00:02:04.547 --> 00:02:05.912
My cousin, not the filter.

00:02:05.912 --> 00:02:07.723
- So how tall is she?

00:02:08.543 --> 00:02:09.316
- Yes.

00:02:18.348 --> 00:02:19.578
- Don't worry.

00:02:19.578 --> 00:02:20.642
We'll use one of mine.

00:02:20.642 --> 00:02:21.988
Four inches up.

00:02:21.988 --> 00:02:23.474
One centimeter down.

00:02:23.474 --> 00:02:24.937
[Maya] Ah, lower.

00:02:24.937 --> 00:02:26.632
How many likes do you
want? How many likes?

00:02:26.632 --> 00:02:27.584
- Like 25.

00:02:27.584 --> 00:02:28.583
- 25?

00:02:28.583 --> 00:02:30.626
- Am I looking through the
screen or into the camera?

00:02:30.626 --> 00:02:32.205
- Look into your soul.

00:02:32.205 --> 00:02:33.798
Go back to a happy place.

00:02:34.889 --> 00:02:39.103
The date is July 4th, Independence Day.

00:02:39.103 --> 00:02:42.632
A film starring Will
Smith, you went to see it

00:02:42.632 --> 00:02:44.256
