00:02:49.712 --> 00:02:50.896
Take your selfie.

00:02:50.896 --> 00:02:52.870
- I don't even know her now.

00:02:55.076 --> 00:02:56.093
- [Simon] It's perfect.

00:02:57.043 --> 00:02:57.640
Thank you.

00:02:57.640 --> 00:02:58.522
- You're welcome.

00:02:58.522 --> 00:02:59.442
- Thank you.

00:03:00.371 --> 00:03:01.105
- [Maya] I know.

00:03:02.196 --> 00:03:03.120
I know.

00:03:04.188 --> 00:03:05.670
It will be $5,000.

00:03:05.670 --> 00:03:09.102
When a photo is taken of you.

00:03:09.359 --> 00:03:10.509
